  "name": "Negative Energy Flood",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Ribbons of negative energy strike a creature within 60 ft: CON save, 3d10 + 25 Necrotic damage on a failure, half on a success. An Undead target instead gains 3d10 Temporary Hit Points (automatic). A Humanoid killed by the spell rises at the start of your next turn as a Zombie under your orders for 24 hours (by hand). +1d10 per slot level above 5.</p>",
